B.Se=new A.qd("\ud83d\udcb9 Oran Takibi \xb7 G\xfcnl\xfck 1/X/2 Oranlar\u0131","Ger\xe7ek 1/X/2 ma\xe7 oranlar\u0131n\u0131n g\xfcn g\xfcn hareketi. Bir g\xfcn se\xe7in; 15 ma\xe7\u0131n o g\xfcne ait m\xfch\xfcrl\xfc oran\u0131 kendi sat\u0131r\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr (\xf6r. 1: 1.61 \xb7 X: 3.20 \xb7 2: 4.25). Oran bir \xf6nceki g\xfcne g\xf6re y\xfckseldi (\u25b2), d\xfc\u015ft\xfc (\u25bc) veya sabit (=) olarak i\u015faretlenir.\n\nRadar 3 (Oynanma DNA) kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n oynama Y\xdcZDES\u0130N\u0130, Radar 4 ise ger\xe7ek 1/X/2 ORANINI g\xf6sterir \u2014 burada y\xfczde de\u011fil, oran vard\u0131r.\n\nHer g\xfcn\xfcn oran\u0131 23:55'te (ma\xe7 g\xfcn\xfc ilk ma\xe7tan 5 dk \xf6nce) m\xfch\xfcrlenir ve sonradan de\u011fi\u015fmez.",null,null)
B.Sf=new A.qd("\ud83d\udee1 Rakip G\xfcc\xfc & Saha Performans\u0131",'Form, rakibin MA\xc7 TAR\u0130H\u0130NDEK\u0130 ligdeki yerine g\xf6re tart\u0131l\u0131r (bug\xfcnk\xfc tablo ge\xe7mi\u015fe uygulanmaz). Ev sahibi yaln\u0131z \u0130\xc7 SAHA, deplasman yaln\u0131z DEPLASMAN ma\xe7lar\u0131yla de\u011ferlendirilir. Zay\u0131f rakiplere kar\u015f\u0131 gelen seriler "\u015ei\u015firilmi\u015f Form", g\xfc\xe7l\xfc rakiplere kar\u015f\u0131 gelenler "Kaliteli Form" olarak etiketlenir; ham form da ayr\u0131ca g\xf6sterilir \u2014 hi\xe7bir veri gizlenmez.',null,null)
B.Sg=new A.qd("\ud83d\udcca Oynanma DNA \xb7 G\xfcnl\xfck 1/X/2 Y\xfczdeleri","Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n 1/X/2 OYNAMA Y\xdcZDES\u0130N\u0130N g\xfcn g\xfcn de\u011fi\u015fimi. Bir g\xfcn se\xe7in; 15 ma\xe7\u0131n o g\xfcne ait m\xfch\xfcrl\xfc y\xfczdesi kendi sat\u0131r\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr (\xf6r. 1 %62 \xb7 X %21 \xb7 2 %17). Y\xfczde bir \xf6nceki g\xfcne g\xf6re y\xfckseldi (\u25b2), d\xfc\u015ft\xfc (\u25bc) veya sabit (=) olarak i\u015faretlenir.\n\nBu bir ORAN de\u011fildir \u2014 Radar 4 (Oran Takibi) ger\xe7ek oran\u0131 g\xf6sterir; Radar 3 oynanma y\xfczdesidir.\n\nHer g\xfcn\xfcn y\xfczdesi 23:55'te (ma\xe7 g\xfcn\xfc ilk ma\xe7tan 5 dk \xf6nce) m\xfch\xfcrlenir ve sonradan de\u011fi\u015fmez. Kaynak yoksa uydurma y\xfczde g\xf6sterilmez.",null,null)
